  "title": "Rhubarb Drop Cookies",
  "description": "These fresh rhubarb cookies with raisins and nuts have a deliciously sweet and tangy flavor for the perfect afternoon snack or after-dinner treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Rachel"
  ],
